❗️ Last night, the Armed Forces of the Russian Federation continued to launch group strikes with long-range air-based high-precision weapons and drones.

As a result of the strikes:

📍 at the Odessa port (the Sea Commercial Port of Odessa State Enterprise), facilities of the port infrastructure used for the unloading of petroleum, oil, and lubricants, and tanks of the POL intended to support the AFU were hit. Two workshops for the production and assembly of unmanned aerial vehicles, including the assembly unit of the UJ-22 medium-range UAV (UKRJET company), were also damaged in Odessa port;

📍 a container ship and a dry cargo ship delivering supplies to the Armed Forces of Ukraine have been hit at the port of Chernomorsk (the Sea Commercial Port of Chernomorsk State Enterprise) in Odessa region;

📍 at the port of Dnepro-Bugskiy (the Sea Commercial Port of Dnepro-Bugskiy State Enterprise), two dry ships delivering cargo to the AFU were hit during of unloading in Nikolayev region.

🔹 Russian Defence Ministry

